[[Conflux]] is a [[unique|non-unique]] [[WvW]]-exclusive [[legendary trinket]]. Up to two rings can be stored in the [[Legendary Armory]], allowing to equip two rings at once, one in each slot. It requires the ownership of ''[[Guild Wars 2: Heart of Thorns]]'' [[expansion]].

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|The ring was fixed on his left hand, a reminder of the battle days before. While they held [[Stonemist Castle|Stonemist]], it could be minutes until their enemy appeared at the front gate. There was no time for mourning.}}

