* Prior to the [[Game updates/2021-07-13|July 13, 2021]] ([[Legendary Armory]]) release, the following recipe was used to upgrade the [[Slumbering Conflux]] into '''Conflux'''.
* With the introduction of the [[Legendary Armory]] and the addition of toggles for accessory visual effects, the legendary ring [[Slumbering Conflux]] is no longer obtainable, but previously crafted rings can be still upgraded into Conflux by using the historical recipe.
